  "contentHtml": "<p>1. 엄지척 도장을 구입했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ae45aa9200eb130cf521a60f5fc1231360e7f62\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ae45aa9200eb130cf521a60f5fc1231360e7f62\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div><p>2. 매시간 학습지를 걷어서 검사하면서&#160;</p><p>&#160;1) 잘된 학습지 부분에 엄지척 도장을 여러군데 찍어줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24dea04bab44c9ce4351768a5954db9a7fc12aca\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"119\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24dea04bab44c9ce4351768a5954db9a7fc12aca\" data-origin-width=\"641\" data-origin-height=\"190\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;2) 부족한 학습지 부분에는 엄지꽝^^ 도장을 찍어줍니다.</p><p>&#160; &#160; 수정해서 제출하면 &#39;엄지척&#39; 도장을 다시 찍어줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63c61219104635eea6506b1147d70ecfcdd80c3a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"200\" height=\"147\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63c61219104635eea6506b1147d70ecfcdd80c3a\" data-origin-width=\"362\" data-origin-height=\"266\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>3. 엄지척 누적 갯수로 상품 or 수행평가에 반영할까 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>4.&#160; 매차시 학습지 피드백 방법 및 효과를 소개합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;1) 초간단 학습지 피드백 방법 :</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/252\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/252</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/252\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=F1n&amp;datanum=252\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/252\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/252\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;2) 15초의 법칙&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4v_xFIF4F8k?si=1S7wVRr-ZltVm3bU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/4v_xFIF4F8k?si=1S7wVRr-ZltVm3bU</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4v_xFIF4F8k\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bJujjw/hyVxq937f9/vubpyOoEFNb1E039qdlz91/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4v_xFIF4F8k\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
